---
import Image from 'astro/components/Image.astro';

import Container from '@components/Container.astro';
import Article from '@components/Article.astro';
import Header from '@components/Header.astro';
import Section from '@components/Section.astro';

import aboutImage from '@assets/images/team.png';
---

<Section spacing="md">
  <Container>
    <div class="layout">
      <div class="media">
        <Image
          class="image"
          src={aboutImage}
          alt="The Vacations with Character team"
          sizes="(min-width: 1530px) 622px, (min-width: 992px) calc((85vw - 4px - 3rem) / 2), calc(85vw - 4px)"
          widths={[622 * 2, 622, 311]}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="text">
        <Article>
          <Header as="h2" family="body" size="xl" color="navy">
            About Vacations with Character
          </Header>
          <p>
            At Vacations with Character&trade;, we believe the best vacations
            are about more than destinations. They're about meaningful
            experiences, lasting connections, and memories that become part of
            your family's story.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our journey began in 2008 with a passion for travel and a vision for
            helping others explore the world. In 2015, that vision grew into the
            boutique travel agency known today as Vacations with
            Character&trade;.
          </p>

          <p><strong>What does "Character" mean to us?</strong></p>

          <p>
            It's more than a beloved mouse, a magical castle, or a favorite
            storybook character. It represents the values at the heart of our
            agency: honesty, integrity, dedication, creativity, and a genuine
            commitment to the families and travelers who trust us.
          </p>

          <p>
            Our team of experienced travel advisors, affectionately known as our
            Vacationistas, believes that no two vacations should be exactly
            alike. We take the time to listen, understand your priorities, and
            help create travel experiences that reflect your interests, dreams,
            and budget.
          </p>

          <p>
            We often talk about the 18 summers we have with our children before
            they're grown. But meaningful moments aren't limited to childhood or
            summer vacations. Whether you're traveling as a couple, creating
            traditions with your children, exploring the world with
            grandparents, or celebrating life's milestones, every season offers
            opportunities to make memories that matter.
          </p>

          <p>
            From the first conversation to the moment you return home, we're
            here to provide knowledgeable guidance, thoughtful planning, and
            personalized service.
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong
              >Because at Vacations with Character&trade;, we're not simply
              planning vacations. We're helping you make moments matter.</strong
            >
          </p>

          <p>
            Vacations with Character&trade;<br /><em
              >Making Moments Matter Since 2008</em
            >
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong
              >Ready to create your next unforgettable experience? Let's start
              planning!</strong
            >
          </p>
        </Article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Section>

<style>
  .layout {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
  }

  .image {
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    border-width: 2px;
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: hsl(var(--color--gray--100));
  }

  @media (width < 62rem) {
    .media {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  @media (width >= 62rem) {
    .layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      align-items: center;
    }
  }
</style>
